# Results ARE tracked so they can be reviewed from GitHub: results.json, fold/subject CSVs,
# alignment_metrics.json, physiology_correlations.json, selected_profile.json, text reports,
# logs, run_all_status*.json, report*/ tables and reports/. Both protocols are covered
# (results/ = blocks, results_session/ = session).
# Only heavy or regenerable files are ignored:
**/results*/**/*.npy
**/results*/**/*.npz
**/results*/**/*.png
**/results*/**/erd_cache/
**/results*/**/physiology_cache/
**/report*/*/figures/
# PhysioNet: preprocessed-window cache (rebuilt automatically)
cache/
